<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0677_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Jamie</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0677_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You real good at scrappin’.\nWe should scrap again sometime.\rTakin’ on a tough Hustler like you,\nI think I can get better too.\rSo wassup?\nYou gon’ gimme your\fnumber? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0677_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Let’s scrap again sometime!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0677_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s too bad...\nLmk if you change your mind.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0677_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Takin’ on a tough Hustler like you,\nI think I can get better too.\rSo wassup? You gon’ gimme\nyour number? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0677_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語"></language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0677_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? You... Ain’t you right nearby?\rWhy not come here and just talk\nface-to-face?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0677_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You remember my\nsweet {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0}?\r{STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} run SO fast.\rIt’s a rush ridin’ on its\nback when it deadass get goin’.\rBye-bye!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0677_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, you ever seen a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}\nbefore?\rI just scrapped one...\nIt was WAY faster than I expected.\rI was kinda shook.\nI still won, obviously.\rBye-bye!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0677_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, I just saw a wild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}.\nI was tryna catch it when I\fnoticed I was all outta\fHood Balls.\rIf you don’t check your items, you\nmight run out at the worst time.\fLearn from my mistake.\rBye-bye!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0677_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You wanna scrap? I’m finna win\nthis time!\rI’ll be waitin’ for you around\n{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}. Look for me, OK?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0677_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Um... {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}? What’s wrong?\nYou forget our deal?\r{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.\nThat’s where I’m waitin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0677_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Um... {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}? What’s wrong?\nYou forget our deal?\r{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.\nThat’s where I’m waitin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0677_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Let’s scrap again\nsometime!</language>
	</row>
